@ShopEx_HostAddress = http://localhost:5009

### RMS Suppliers
GET {{ShopEx_HostAddress}}/api/RMSSuppliers
Accept: application/json

### RMS Supplier Items
GET {{ShopEx_HostAddress}}/api/RMSSuppliers/1/items
Accept: application/json

### ============================================================
### ShopEx Supplier Invoices
### ============================================================

### Get Supplier Invoice By ID
GET {{ShopEx_HostAddress}}/api/SupplierInvoices/1
Accept: application/json

### Create Supplier Invoice
POST {{ShopEx_HostAddress}}/api/SupplierInvoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rmsSupplierID": 1,
  "invoiceNumber": "INV-2026-001",
  "invoiceDate": "2026-11-13T00:00:00Z",
  "notes": "First invoice purchase",
  "paymentType": 2,
  "creditDays": 30,
  "items": [
    {
      "rmsItemID": 101,
      "quantity": 10,
      "unitPrice": 50.00
    },
    {
      "rmsItemID": 102,
      "quantity": 5,
      "unitPrice": 120.00
    }
  ]
}

### Add Payment to Supplier Invoice
POST {{ShopEx_HostAddress}}/api/SupplierInvoices/1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 500.00,
  "paymentMethod": "Cash"
}

### ============================================================
### RMS Worksheets (PO Planner Process)
### ============================================================

### 1. Open Worksheet (Status = 1 PendingApproval)
POST {{ShopEx_HostAddress}}/api/RMSWorksheets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "PO Planner Weekly Batch",
  "notes": "Worksheet for Cairo Store"
}

### 2. Add Purchase Orders to Opened Worksheet (Linked by WorksheetID, Status = 1)
POST {{ShopEx_HostAddress}}/api/RMSWorksheets/1/purchases
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "itemId": 101,
    "description": "Item Description Sample",
    "qty": 50,
    "price": 25.50,
    "storeId": 1,
    "taxRate": 0.14
  },
  {
    "itemId": 102,
    "description": "Another Item Sample",
    "qty": 20,
    "price": 80.00,
    "storeId": 1,
    "taxRate": 0.14
  }
]

### 3. Open Worksheet with Purchases directly (Combined)
POST {{ShopEx_HostAddress}}/api/RMSWorksheets/with-purchases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "PO Planner All In One",
  "notes": "Worksheet created directly with purchase lines",
  "items": [
    {
      "itemId": 101,
      "description": "Item 101",
      "qty": 100,
      "price": 15.00,
      "storeId": 1,
      "taxRate": 0.14
    }
  ]
}

### 4. Get Worksheet By ID (Shows status and linked purchase orders)
GET {{ShopEx_HostAddress}}/api/RMSWorksheets/1
Accept: application/json

### 5. Approve Worksheet (Status converted from 1 to 2 Approved)
POST {{ShopEx_HostAddress}}/api/RMSWorksheets/1/approve
Accept: application/json
